am":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n9p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"861fc716-7ef5-49c0-aae6-1cfd79deef92","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/gorilla0513/status/1366547881998475268?s=20\u003e","ts":"1617179373.240100","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/gorilla0513|@gorilla0513\u003e: Ubuntuで、softwareアップデートしたらデスクトップがこんなになってしまった…\nなぜだ \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/Evbz9PAU4AIwllw.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"シン・エヴァンゴリラ:‖","author_subname":"@gorilla0513","author_link":"https://twitter.com/gorilla0513/status/1366547881998475268","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1348486174914957314/-RJqWxMK_normal.jpg","text":"Ubuntuで、softwareアップデートしたらデスクトップがこんなになってしまった…\nなぜだ \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/Evbz9PAU4AIwllw.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Evbz9PAU4AIwllw.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1614645378,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/gorilla0513/status/1366547881998475268?s=20","original_url":"https://twitter.com/gorilla0513/status/1366547881998475268?s=20"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p+kY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7127eca5-cce7-4b87-a93f-798762ee9859","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なんだろ。同じような症例を調べてみるか","ts":"1617178537.239600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Du6ng"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4dba3e22-ffa3-468e-9f66-ef273c270bb6","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"自分のUbuntu環境でもGUIのフリーズが顕著になってきた","ts":"1617178513.239000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=I6j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b6b4984-c585-400c-877f-118dea52edad","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"コンパイルがめちゃくちゃ速ければドライバ混みで毎回 `make buildworld` (FreeBSD的なアレ)でも良いんだよな。そうなるとOS側はgenericsモリモリで作られて void* 使うシーンを避けられるみたいなのも、視野に入るかもしれない。","ts":"1617173487.238100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Npvk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81b1bddb-46fd-4bac-9520-af72e3087ed5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まとめると、ハードウェア操作そのものはRustでもunsafe使わずにできそうだけど、OSとのインタラクトの観点ではunsafeを避けられない、って感じかな。","ts":"1617173342.236000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r6JN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3157397d-d6c0-4d1a-a32e-4df283da442c","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"Rust の str も C の char* ではないので struct に色々めんどくさいことをしないといけなそう。","ts":"1617172057.234900","edited":{"user":"U03C6TEAZ","ts":"1617172063.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uXP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e42b34d-9e90-4513-95c9-e7ba4fe83288","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ですです。そのあたり。ページ操作とかでは結構使いそう。","ts":"1617171778.233900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"09Su"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd0bb09e-351f-410c-9285-0c9869fbd2e6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あードライバが確保したメモリ(構造体)をvoid*にキャストしてOSに預けて、それを受け取って元の構造体にキャストしなおす。その時にunsafeが必要なんてのはありそうなシナリオだ。","ts":"1617171611.233400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h/jn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ad5d532-2996-4baa-b147-a333d7f25a5d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"モノによっては割込み禁止\u0026amp;許可は要るけどそのあたりはDDK的なものの範疇かしらね。","ts":"1617171433.232200","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1617171448.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gdz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a31e45c-c343-4fa8-ab2c-4a5ba5123d3f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"(私は Linux のドライバなんて書いたことがない素人なので雰囲気で発言しています :bow:)","ts":"1617171407.231700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C2G0c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a199b22-0754-4256-9b26-664512ec7536","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それと適切なwaitとかbusy loopか","ts":"1617171360.231000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8FxSS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91731b43-09ed-4482-ba17-adf1d7da023b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"たぶん、ちゃんと書けばほとんどunsafeなくてもなんとかなるデバドラは多いんではなかろうか","ts":"1617171356.230900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xbb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52259e89-1840-4ebc-9215-f4b85a64aabe","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ハードウェア周りだと、volatileは要る。あとは特定のメモリポインタへの読み書きかな。","ts":"1617171347.230600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D2RoA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"045a07bb-1130-48b6-a490-c3f75b924ffb","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"まぁrustでも書き直すって話じゃないですからね","ts":"1617171306.229400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PSn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cadae0d-8b0c-46f2-a95a-5ee725c93896","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"gopher-goしらんかったー","ts":"1617171296.229100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pENK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66e91774-a657-4082-8bbf-563b992a5334","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; GoはGoのままでいいと思う\nこれは自分も思いますね\nただ、チャレンジしてみたい気持ちもあります","ts":"1617171292.228800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SlTcN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3979e127-fcae-46e9-920d-0415d2b38178","type":"message","u