l":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gT11j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71af8dc8-d236-4558-9c8b-bbf9e7395306","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとMSのベータ版は絶対にインストールしない。Win 98でひどい目にあった。","ts":"1617161850.206200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mks4Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"927c7392-5791-467a-82b1-131e3b40a674","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"けいとらさんも似たようなこと言ってましたね。だからNeovimのバージョンもStableで固定してるって","ts":"1617161565.205700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q=v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23f6c03f-7e54-41d7-b8aa-18dfcb06d731","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"仕事環境では攻めないことを大事にしてる。","ts":"1617161500.204900","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1617161512.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WDOg="}]},{"client_msg_id":"e543d5d2-1cfb-479f-aaa3-89246662bce0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"本当は深堀りしたかったけど、今そんな事やっている場合じゃねぇって気持ちでクリーンインストール","ts":"1617161425.204400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Agum"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7504c02c-3500-4bb6-ad58-d98c18faeddc","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"ほどよい範囲でバグも踏めるし","ts":"1617161041.203400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IKAxd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce516e9a-1d3f-4849-8422-e10043b6b0f9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ローリングリリースは最高","ts":"1617160996.202400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y6ytA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ce4d3c4-1caf-4557-83c1-dd76710125a5","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"まぁこういうOSアップデート系はどこが変わったのか影響範囲が大きすぎて大変じゃないでしょうか。\nOSアップデートして上手くいくときは行くけど、上手くいかないときは上手くいかない。そもそもOSのアップデータを信じてないので私はクリーンインストールします。\nPythonインストールして環境壊れるたびにOS再インストールというのは、ちょっと問題を先送りにしすぎ感はありますが、今回の件とかは。。","ts":"1617160974.202200","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1617161008.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oZFs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07eafee6-a018-4fbb-9c36-ac8f90a0286b","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"昔よりも遊び道具（エンジニア的な）増えたから、最近は別にやらなくてもいいとは思ってます。\nなにか作業の取っ掛かりがなくて、暇してるなら追いかけた方がためになる。","ts":"1617160928.202000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BAc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd4f04a7-57de-4de8-b084-3402188f0cb3","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ちなみに仕事で使ってるデスクトップWindowsは安定を重視した運用なので、そこがベースラインにあるという安心感はある。","ts":"1617160867.201300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KgTP/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5465d4e4-02ae-46a3-874f-5ff81db28ae8","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"仕事としてなら飛ばしちゃうけど趣味の時は追う。なぜならそういうトラブルこそが成長だったり知識の獲得を促すから。","ts":"1617160810.199700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZM3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e652b3da-44f9-4d6e-841c-6f4c9173bb37","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"深堀りする気力がなかった","ts":"1617160758.198600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pTwu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3225d88b-44e4-4a50-9cd2-ca91e36f0cce","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"OS層から極力状態を無くしたいのでインストールスクリプト書いてカジュアルに吹き飛ばしてる","ts":"1617160596.197900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yK/GC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5faa08f2-04bd-4558-b884-160e2a32f312","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"まあ私も昔はよく追いかけてましたが、最近は不毛っぽいんで（アップグレードスクリプトの想定不備だったりおま環だったりするから）あんまりやらないようにはしてますが・・・","ts":"1617160540.197800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ppx1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4687572-8415-40ac-be4a-992d9c4c03bb","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"僕の場合は深追いしてだいたい原因まで掘り下げますね。\n\n(ここまで遭遇したのはできている)","ts":"1617160488.196900","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1617160498.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0OQqN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1fd4c992-f34a-4110-86de-e76d27bd943d","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"あのUbuntuのアップグレードの不具合だけはなんかWindowsっぽいんですよね。深追いしてみてもよくわからず再インストールしてみればあっさり解決するという。。。","ts":"1617160465.196000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cGouO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24d805ae-d6f1-4662-8988-79d873ae013f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いちばんきつかったのは起動すると10分程度でフリーズするやつ。普段使いではカーネルのバージョンを下げて対応してた。最終的にグラフィックドライバーを明示的に指定することで治ったんだけども。","ts":"1617160295.194200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZB2u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5064e074-51dc-4cf2-9d6e-7f4f4ac62985","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"僕の中では再インストールは甘え、なんだよね。ちゃんと調べて直してる(これまでは直せてる)。そういえばWindowsも基本再インストールしないな。\n\nノートPCを買い替えたときはする。デスクトップはディスククローンして移行してるか。","ts":"1617160204.193000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A8E+H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6510b712-99b7-40ee-9151-8f557af05f97","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"確かにUbuntu GUI自分の環境でもたまに固まる","ts":"1617159910.191400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w8Gy8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69fd2a30-9f80-452f-8ff2-8072bff5b45d","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"昔(8.04とか)はアップグレードしたらGUIよく重くなってましたね。とりあえず成功するか試してみるけどやったあとは再インストールしてました","ts":"1617158557.190800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CyMa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e437d3d-8585-47eb-b6bd-cb30c5875f1b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"とても辛い","ts":"1617156400.189600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Dn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4dbf228a-1179-4811-9e4f-5b1fde03c183","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"Ubuntuでそこまで壊れるの珍しいですね。。","ts":"1617156382.189400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mge"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44bf8028-8f52-43be-9512-cca36dc0d561","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"パッケージupdateしたら、GUIが壊れかけて、昨日入れ直した時点ではブラウザがおもすぎてまともに使えないレベルでした","ts":"1617152110.189100","edited":{"user":"UDDCM376D","ts":"1617152122.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"koP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f37bca79-2f39-4411-8d3e-5ea9f73beded","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"同じOSで同じバージョンすね","ts":"1617152060.188200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pgV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ebcdc2b4-305c-4530-af32-905da3df96e8","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"powertop だっけ。","ts":"1617148092.188000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qdsQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a898912-ae44-437f-9807-048077cd7fc7","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"TLP なんかで小細工すると逆にパフォーマンス落ちたりする場合があるけど、それだったのかな？","ts":"1617148066.187800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mclu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7811b32